.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
    babel\&.messages\&.jslexer
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

    A simple JavaScript 1\&.5 lexer which is used for the JavaScript
    extractor\&.

