.fi
.PP
 
.SS " Generator[\fBToken\fP, None, None] babel\&.messages\&.jslexer\&.tokenize (str source, bool  jsx = \fCTrue\fP, bool  dotted = \fCTrue\fP, bool  template_string = \fCTrue\fP, int  lineno = \fC1\fP)"

.PP
.nf
Tokenize JavaScript/JSX source\&.  Returns a generator of tokens\&.

:param source: The JavaScript source to tokenize\&.
:param jsx: Enable (limited) JSX parsing\&.
:param dotted: Read dotted names as single name token\&.
:param template_string: Support ES6 template strings
:param lineno: starting line number (optional)

.fi
.PP
 
.SS " str babel\&.messages\&.jslexer\&.unquote_string (str string)"

.PP
.nf
Unquote a string with JavaScript rules\&.  The string has to start with
string delimiters (``'``, ``'`` or the back-tick/grave accent (for template strings)\&.)

.fi
.PP
 
